#     → clamp(53,80,100) = ceil5_eff=80 (static).
# Sub-assertion A: used_5h=70 → h5=80-70=10 → N=clamp(round(8*10/30),1,8)=3
#   (byte-identical to Test 16b's mid-week ramp value).
